            <div xml:id="d493">

                <pb facs="0568" n="464" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg464"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.51/962.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-02-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 24, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am requested to inform you that the Dominican Government has definitively
                    accepted the proposal of the National City Bank, after seriously considering all
                    the objections raised by the National Bank of Santo Domingo. Your instructions
                    have been strictly complied with and I have declared on all occasions that my
                    Government leaves the Dominican Government absolutely free to choose between the
                    two propositions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
